OL,3,GNEWSANew exhibit teaches children about
OL,4,Arailway dangers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new exhibit designed to teach
OL,7,Fchildren about the dangers of playing
OL,8,Fnear railway lines has opened after a
OL,9,F#100,000 investment.
OL,11,FLeicester-based charity Warning Zone
OL,12,Fhas recreated a railway crossing and
OL,13,Finstalled an interactive train display.
OL,15,FThe additional exhibit has been
OL,16,Fdeveloped in partnership with Network
OL,17,FRail, East Midlands Railway and others.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
