OL,3,GNEWSANew exhibit teaches children about
OL,4,Arailway dangers
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnya Caldwell, community safety manager
OL,7,Ffor Network Rail, said "We are seeing
OL,8,Fvideos and recordings of students
OL,9,Fmessing around on these level
OL,10,Fcrossings, exhibiting some really
OL,11,Fdangerous behaviour. So that's why
OL,12,Fwe've sort of honed in on the
OL,13,FLeicestershire area."
